    Runtime --> Swarm[USRSwarmSubsystem]
    Swarm --> Grid[100 cm spatial hash]
    Swarm --> Pools[Enemy and XP gem pools]
    Swarm --> Enemy[ASREnemyBase]
    Swarm --> Gem[ASRExpGem]
